// H2 price leg: bonded-price judgment and valuation (producer bonds,
// challenges/disputes through stake, resolve, freeze, claims, fallback set).
// Activates with the H2 bonds primitives gate by default; the committee moves
// it (with the primitives gate) apart from the gateway leg at scheduling.
// The only consensus-pinned property is the order: gateway strictly before
// price (BSIP-1 section 6). Before it passes, every price-leg op stays
// rejected, so no node can produce a block a pre-fork node cannot validate.
#ifndef HARDFORK_H2_PRICE_TIME
#define HARDFORK_H2_PRICE_TIME (fc::time_point_sec( 1893456000 )) // 2030-01-01T00:00:00Z
#define HARDFORK_H2_PRICE_PASSED(now) (now >= HARDFORK_H2_PRICE_TIME)
#endif
